                    </div>
                    <div class="pd-ov-body">
                        <div class="pd-overview-text" id="overviewText" style="max-height:120px;overflow:hidden">
                            <p>3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire is a residential project by Amann Infradevelopment Ltd, located in the prestigious Borivali West, Mumbai. Designed as a Apartment, the project offers spacious and thoughtfully crafted 3 BHK residences tailored for modern living. It is currently in the Ready To Move stage. The project reflects world-class planning, superior engineering excellence, and refined luxury living.</p><p>Expansively planned over 951 Sq.Ft., the project offers breathtaking views of the landscaped greens and open spaces. The plush residences range from varied sizes and include thoughtfully designed layouts with 3 Bedrooms, 3 Bathrooms.</p><p>From the grand entrance lobby to the elegantly designed interiors, every aspect of the project defines sophistication and attention to detail. Residents can enjoy world-class lifestyle amenities such as a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, wellness and fitness centres, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, sports facilities, kids' play areas, and more.</p><p>Buyers can explore detailed floor plans, project images, specifications, and master layouts through the official brochure and sales gallery. Flexible payment plans are available for both investors and homebuyers. Priced at ₹4.1 Cr Onwards, 3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire offers strong potential for long-term appreciation and rental yield due to its premium location, luxury infrastructure, and trusted developer reputation.</p><p>Whether you are an end-user looking for an upscale lifestyle or an investor seeking capital appreciation, 3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire offers a compelling opportunity in one of Mumbai's fastest-growing luxury corridors.</p>                        </div>
                        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="pd-ov-readmore" id="overviewBtn" onclick="toggleOverview()">+ Read More</a>
