                                        <div class="pd-dev-body">
                                                <div class="pd-dev-name">Amann Infradevelopment Ltd</div>
                                                                                                                        <div class="pd-dev-about-wrap collapsed" id="devAboutWrap">
                            <div class="pd-dev-about">
                                <p>Amann Infradevelopment Ltd has built an enduring legacy in real estate, anchored by the values of ethical governance, transparency, commitment, and passion for excellence.</p><p>Amann Infradevelopment Ltd has redefined luxury living by curating iconic residential, commercial, retail, hospitality and leisure developments across Mumbai. Today, Amann Infradevelopment Ltd consistently sets new benchmarks for the industry in India.</p><p>Amann Infradevelopment Ltd's track record speaks for itself with an impressive portfolio of 1 completed project.</p><p>At the core of their success lies a diverse team focused on building sustainable ecosystems that keep pace with India's rapidly evolving real estate needs. Ultimately, they believe that their true strength isn't just in the structures they build, but in the trust they share with their employees, customers, and partners who make it all possible.</p>                            </div>
                            <button class="pd-dev-readmore" onclick="pdDevToggle()">Read More</button>
                        </div>
